    "body": "Not an endorsement for this proposal, but if a unit/measurement tag were to be added I'd push for using the [ECMAScript list of units](https://tc39.es/proposal-unified-intl-numberformat/section6/locales-currencies-tz_proposed_out.html#sec-issanctionedsimpleunitidentifier), and avoiding ambiguous terms like `$` for a unit type.",
